[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3545.829, "timestamp": "00:59:05", "text": "我该怎么做？这就是我想要的。这是一样的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3549.109, "timestamp": "00:59:09", "text": "我打开了窗户。返回。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3552.95, "timestamp": "00:59:12", "text": "那里没有退款选项。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3561.99, "timestamp": "00:59:21", "text": "是的，这是一样的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3564.71, "timestamp": "00:59:24", "text": "所以，我输了，我浪费了我的钱，我到底损失了多少？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3567.99, "timestamp": "00:59:27", "text": "这款键盘多少钱买的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3571.109, "timestamp": "00:59:31", "text": "我花了像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3573.67, "timestamp": "00:59:33", "text": "什么？ 6,000。不，不，那是一起的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3576.309, "timestamp": "00:59:36", "text": "包括所有东西。这三样东西。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3578.23, "timestamp": "00:59:38", "text": "就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3588.47, "timestamp": "00:59:48", "text": "这个多少钱？ 1,329。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3591.67, "timestamp": "00:59:51", "text": "所以是 1300。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3595.589, "timestamp": "00:59:55", "text": "啊，我只是想要60%的分数而已。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3597.19, "timestamp": "00:59:57", "text": "键盘。"}]